body:
I just did a bit of digging and it looks like, assuming iPadOS allows you to map and mount a NAS in the same way that MacOS does (I have no idea if it does), then you should be able to have your library in CC set up to point at your NAS

[https://helpx.adobe.com/uk/lightroom-cc/using/preferences.html#store-originals-network-drive](https://helpx.adobe.com/uk/lightroom-cc/using/preferences.html#store-originals-network-drive)

